{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"Nigrodha","html":"<article id='thag1.21'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Theragāthā 1.21 </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Verses of the Senior Monks 1.21 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Ekakanipāta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Book of the Ones </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Tatiyavagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Chapter Three </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>Nigrodhattheragāthā </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Nigrodha </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Nāhaṁ bhayassa bhāyāmi, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>I’m not afraid of fear, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Satthā no amatassa kovido; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>for our teacher is expert in freedom from death. </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Yattha bhayaṁ nāvatiṭṭhati, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Mendicants advance by the path </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Tena maggena vajanti bhikkhavo”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>where no fear remains. </span></span></p></blockquote>\n<p class='endsutta'><span class='root'>… Nigrodho thero …. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p></article>"}
